    text: "On the way to you.\n\nHello{{#first_name}} {{first_name}}{{/first_name}},\n\nOrder {{order_reference}} has been dispatched for delivery. Please keep your phone nearby so the delivery team can reach you.\n\nMake the handover easy\nBe ready to share a nearby landmark if the delivery team needs directions. If your location has changed, contact us as soon as possible.\n\nView delivery status: {{order_url}}\n\nOrder: {{order_reference}}\nPlaced: {{order_date}}\nPayment: {{payment_status}}\nDelivery: {{delivery_location}}\n{{#items}}{{name}} | Qty {{quantity}} × {{unit_price}} | {{line_total}}\n{{/items}}Subtotal: {{subtotal}}\n{{#total_confirmed}}Delivery: {{delivery_fee}}\nOrder total: {{total}}{{/total_confirmed}}{{^total_confirmed}}Delivery fee and final total to be confirmed.{{/total_confirmed}}\n\nReply to this email or call 0705 004545.\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/256705004545\n\nYou received this email about your GoldPlus order.\nGoldPlus, Wilson Road, Kampala, Uganda\nhttps://shopgoldplus.com\n",
