    text: "You’ve reached us. We’re here to help.\n\nHello{{#first_name}} {{first_name}}{{/first_name}},\n\nThank you for contacting GoldPlus. We’ve received your message. Our team will review it and contact you using the details you provided.\n\nAnything else we should know?\nReply to this email with any useful details, such as your order reference, product model or a clear photo of the issue. Please don’t send passwords, PINs or one-time codes.\n\nReply to this email or call 0705 004545.\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/256705004545\n\nYou received this email about a request submitted to GoldPlus.\nGoldPlus, Wilson Road, Kampala, Uganda\nhttps://shopgoldplus.com\n",
