    text: "Let’s get the details right.\n\nHello{{#first_name}} {{first_name}}{{/first_name}},\n\nThank you for asking GoldPlus for a quote. Our sales team will contact you to confirm what you need before preparing it.\n\nHelp us quote accurately\nIf you haven’t already, reply with the product models, quantities and delivery location. Let us know when you need the items, too. This acknowledgement is not a confirmed order.\n\nReply to this email or call 0705 004545.\nWhatsApp: https://wa.me/256705004545\n\nYou received this email about a request submitted to GoldPlus.\nGoldPlus, Wilson Road, Kampala, Uganda\nhttps://shopgoldplus.com\n",
